WEBVTT

00:02:00.139 --> 00:02:04.332
so much so that I wrote
a young-adult novel

00:02:04.356 --> 00:02:06.903
called "Juliet Takes a Breath,"

00:02:06.927 --> 00:02:10.212
about a chubby, queer
Puerto Rican girl from the Bronx

00:02:10.236 --> 00:02:13.427
navigating sexuality, family and identity.

00:02:15.006 --> 00:02:16.993
And on the strength of "Juliet,"

00:02:17.017 --> 00:02:21.533
Marvel Comics tapped me
to write the solo series

00:02:21.557 --> 00:02:26.363
for their first-ever
Latina lesbian superhero,

00:02:26.387 --> 00:02:28.253
America Chavez.

00:02:28.277 --> 00:02:29.428
Yeah!

00:02:29.452 --> 00:02:31.832
(Cheers)